               <date isodate="1890-10-23" xml:id="date_cc9f1f05">1890-10-23</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_b6f875e4">
               <p xml:id="idm91">In 1890 Leopold Budde published the collection "Jule-Fortællinger" (Christmas Tales), illustrated by Carl Thomsen with compositions by Hartmann. The other songs are "Vel mødt i Julens Stue" (HartW 477) and "Se, nu har Stormen fejet rent" (HartW 478). Why somebody thought that Vilhelm Gregersen was the text author, as mentioned in the autograph score, is unknown.</p>
            </history>
